# Tokens — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

Fills the schema defined in {{SPEC_PATH}}. Consumers reference role names,
never literals — this file is the single place values change. This file is
**normative over `DESIGN.md` prose**: when they disagree, this file and the
shipped renders win, and the disagreement itself is a defect to log.

Every value change cites the round that ruled it (`// round N`), and stale
values are corrected in place with the old value noted — not silently
replaced.

## color

```text
color {
  <role>   <variant-a> #RRGGBB   <variant-b> #RRGGBB   // provenance note
}
```

